(I)--the seventh अवतार् of विष्णु; born with दक्षिणा as twins to अकूती and Ruci. Adopted as his son by his grandfather स्वायम्भुव Manu.
1: भा. I. 3. १२; III. १९. १३; IV. 1. 4-5; VI. 8. १५; VIII. 1. 6.
Followed by the याम gods, slew the Asuras and यातुधानस् who attacked and sought to devour स्वायम्भुव Manu engaged in con- templation of Hari, and ruled the celestial kingdom;
2: Ib. VIII. 1. १७-18; X. 6. २२.
wor- shipped for attaining celebrity;
3: Ib. II. 3. 7; Br. II. ३४. 7.
to यज्ञ and दक्षिणा were born twelve sons who were known as यामस् in the period of स्वायम्भुव; यज्ञ also याम;
4: वा. १०. १९-20; Br. II. 9. ४४ff.
constitutes धर्म and [page३-005+ ४४] मन्त्र; the Yajva goes to heaven;
5: वा. ३२. १६.
a soma yajus of पशु, द्रव्य, हविस्, ऋत्विक्स्, दक्षिण।
6: Ib. ५७. १०७; ५९. ४२.

